# PHASE 3B BUG VALIDATION REPORT - saveAdjustment Transaction & Duplicate Risk

**Date:** 2026-06-05
**Task:** Audit payroll system - Phase 3B Hypothesis Testing
**Status:** COMPLETE
**Bug ID:** BUG-DB-003
**Verdict:** CONFIRMED BUG — HIGH severity (multi-issue)

---

## 1. Verdict

**CONFIRMED BUG — HIGH severity (multi-issue)**

Dua bug terpisah terkonfirmasi:
1. **Tidak ada transaction wrapper** — SELECT + UPDATE/INSERT adalah operasi terpisah tanpa atomic guarantee
2. **Race condition / duplicate risk** — Tidak ada unique constraint + check-then-act pattern tanpa locking = duplicate record memungkinkan

