## 3. saveAdjustment Flow

```
1. INPUT DITERIMA (dari API route)
   └─ body: ManualAdjustment { period_month, period_year, emp_code, nik, gang_code, division_code, adjustment_type, adjustment_name, amount, remarks, metadata_json, ... }

2. NORMALISASI (local, tidak ada DB call)
   ├─ normalizeManualAdjustmentForSave() — POTONGAN_KOTOR prefix adjustment_name
   ├─ parseFloat(amount) || 0 — parsedAmount
   ├─ normalizeStoredAdjustmentName() — uppercase, collapse whitespace
   ├─ normalizeManualAdjustmentDivisionCode() — 1A→P1A, ARB1→AB1, dll
   ├─ serializeManualAdjustmentMetadata() — convert to JSON string
   ├─ resolveDetailTotalSync() — sync amount dengan metadata_json.total_amount
   ├─ validatePremiumAdjustmentDefinition() — cek nama sesuai premium_definitions.json
   ├─ validateManualAdjustmentAdCode() — ADCode wajib untuk non-AUTO_BUFFER
   └─ buildManualAdjustmentRemarks() — pipe-delimited string

3. IDENTITY RESOLUTION (DB call #1)
   └─ resolveManualAdjustmentIdentity(data)
      ├─ employeeIdentityResolverService.resolve() — resolve NIK/emp_code ke empCode
      ├─ resolveManualAdjustmentIdentityByContext() — lookup by emp_name + gang_code
      └─ resolveManualAdjustmentIdentityByHistory() — lookup by history_hr_employee
      └─ Result: identity = { empCode, nik, empName, originalIdentifier }

4. PENDAPATAN_LAINNYA BRANCH
   └─ Jika adjustment_type === 'PENDAPATAN_LAINNYA' → panggil saveOtherIncome()
      └─ saveOtherIncome: cek by nik, fallback by emp_code, UPDATE atau INSERT

5. STANDARD ADJUSTMENT BRANCH (PREMI, POTONGAN_KOTOR, POTONGAN_BERSIH)
   ├─ 5a. SELECT existing (DB call #2)
   │   └─ SELECT TOP 1 id FROM payroll_manual_adjustments
   │       WHERE period_month = ? AND period_year = ?
   │       AND (emp_code = ? OR nik = ? OR emp_code = ?)  ← DUPLICATE CONDITION
   │       AND adjustment_type = ?
   │       AND normalized_adjustment_name = ?
   │       ORDER BY CASE WHEN emp_code = ? THEN 0 ... id DESC
   │
   ├─ 5b. JIKA ADA existing (existing !== null)
   │   ├─ shouldDeleteStoredAdjustment(effectiveAmount)?
   │   │   ├─ YA: DELETE WHERE id = ? (DB call #3)
   │   │   └─ TIDAK: UPDATE SET ... WHERE id = ? (DB call #3)
   │   └─ return existing.id
   │
   └─ 5c. JIKA TIDAK ADA (existing === null)
       ├─ shouldDeleteStoredAdjustment(effectiveAmount)?
       │   ├─ YA: return 0 (jangan insert amount 0)
       │   └─ TIDAK: INSERT INTO payroll_manual_adjustments ... (DB call #3)
       │       └─ OUTPUT INSERTED.id
       │
       └─ 5d. AUTO-PRESET UPSERT (DB call #4, fire-and-forget)
           └─ try { manualAdjustmentPresetService.upsertPreset() } catch { silent fail }

6. CACHE CLEAR
   └─ cacheService.clearByPattern(`:${period_month}:${period_year}`)

7. RETURN
   └─ return id (number) atau 0
```

**Total DB calls dalam saveAdjustment:** 2-4 query (exclude identity resolution yang complex) — **tidak ada transaction wrapper**.

