## 5. Duplicate Risk Scenario

**Skenario Race Condition:**

```
Timeline:
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
T0  User A buka payroll Mei 2026, edit cell PREMI PRUNING untuk B0077
T1  User B buka payroll Mei 2026, edit cell PREMI PRUNING untuk B0077 (komputer berbeda)
T2  User A klik "Simpan Perubahan" — request A dikirim ke API
T3  Request A tiba di backend: saveAdjustment() dipanggil
T4  DB: SELECT id FROM ... WHERE period=5/2026 AND emp_code=B0077 AND type=PREMI AND name=PREMI PRUNING
T5  DB: result = [] (tidak ada record existing)
T6  Request B tiba di backend: saveAdjustment() dipanggil
T7  DB: SELECT id FROM ... (same query)
T8  DB: result = [] (request A belum commit!)
T9  Request A: INSERT ... → id=100 (DB transaction started)
T10 Request B: INSERT ... → id=101 (DB transaction started) ← RACE WINDOW
T11 Request A: transaction committed → id=100 committed
T12 Request B: transaction committed → id=101 committed
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
RESULT: 2 DUPLICATE RECORDS untuk B0077, PREMI PRUNING, Mei 2026
```

**Dampak ke Report Payroll:**
- Employee B0077 muncul 2x di payroll report untuk PREMI PRUNING
- Total PREMI PRUNING di-gang/group = 2x lipat dari seharusnya
- Jika adjustment_type = PREMI, total_upah_kotor employee = 2x
- upstream payroll aggregation (summary, lampiran) ikut salah

