## 8. Frontend Double Submit Risk

| Protection | Ada? | Detail |
|-----------|------|--------|
| Loading state (`isSavingEdits`) | ✅ Ya | `setIsSavingEdits(true)` di `performSaveAllEdits()` |
| Button disabled saat saving | ✅ Ya | `disabled={isSavingEdits \|\| !hasPendingEdits}` |
| Confirmation untuk delete | ✅ Ya | `openPayrollConfirm({ variant: 'danger', ... })` |
| Debounce/throttle | ❌ Tidak | Tidak ada delay antar-click prevention |
| Request cancellation | ❌ Tidak | Tidak ada AbortController |
| Idempotency key | ❌ Tidak | Setiap save generate request baru |

**Race condition window:**

```
T0  User A klik "Simpan" button
T1  Button disabled? belum — state update belum propagate
T2  User A klik lagi sebelum button re-render dengan disabled
T3  handleSaveAllEdits() dipanggil 2x
T4  openPayrollConfirm() terbuka 2x
T5  User konfirmasi 2x dialog
T6  performSaveAllEdits() × 2 → PARALEL REQUESTS
RESULT: Double save ke backend — race condition di saveAdjustment()
```

**Mitigation yang ada:** `savedCount !== editsArray.length` throw error jika partial success. Tapi ini tidak mencegah double INSERT.

