## 9. Severity Assessment

**HIGH — dengan justifikasi:**

| Faktor | Nilai | Alasan |
|--------|-------|--------|
| Data Loss Scope | MEDIUM | Duplicate record bisa di-cleanup, tapi aggregation sudah salah |
| Data Corruption | HIGH | Payroll totals, lampiran, summary report semua salah karena double amount |
| Detectability | LOW | User tidak tahu ada duplicate; report terlihat normal sampai audit |
| Likelihood | HIGH | Race condition window ~100-500ms di jaringan lokal; mudah terjadi |
| Reversibility | MEDIUM | Duplicate bisa dihapus manual; tapi impact ke history/aggregation tidak bisa di-undo |
| Scope | HIGH | Affects semua adjustment types (PREMI, POTONGAN_KOTOR, dll) |

**Severity breakdown:**
- **No transaction wrapper:** HIGH (partial save risk)
- **Duplicate/race condition:** HIGH (silent data corruption)
- **Amount=0 tanpa confirmation:** MEDIUM (accidental delete)
- **No frontend idempotency:** MEDIUM (double-click causes double save)

