## 11. Safe Fix Recommendation

### Recommendation 1: Transaction Wrapper (Immediate)

**Untuk prevent partial state:**

```typescript
// Di saveAdjustment(), wrap dalam transaction
const queries = [];

if (existing) {
    if (shouldDeleteStoredAdjustment(...)) {
        queries.push({ sql: `DELETE FROM ... WHERE id = ?`, params: [existing.id] });
    } else {
        queries.push({ sql: `UPDATE ... WHERE id = ?`, params: [...] });
    }
} else {
    if (!shouldDeleteStoredAdjustment(...)) {
        queries.push({ sql: `INSERT INTO ...`, params: [...] });
        // INSERT + preset dalam 1 transaction
        if (presetAdCode) {
            queries.push({ sql: `UPSERT preset...`, params: [...] });
        }
    }
}

const success = await db.transaction(queries);
if (!success) throw new Error('Transaction failed, rolled back');
```

### Recommendation 2: Unique Constraint (Safe, Needs Data Cleanup First)

**Sebelum apply constraint, cleanup existing duplicates:**

```sql
-- Step 1: Identify duplicates
-- (use QUERY 1 from section 10)

-- Step 2: Delete duplicates (keep highest id, delete others)
-- WARNING: Execute per-adjustment-type, per-period, backup first
-- DELETE FROM extend_db_ptrj.dbo.payroll_manual_adjustments
-- WHERE id IN (
--     SELECT id FROM (
--         SELECT id, ROW_NUMBER() OVER (
--             PARTITION BY period_month, period_year, emp_code, nik,
--                          gang_code, division_code, adjustment_type, adjustment_name
--             ORDER BY id DESC
--         ) AS rn
--         FROM extend_db_ptrj.dbo.payroll_manual_adjustments
--     ) t WHERE rn > 1
-- );

-- Step 3: Add unique constraint
ALTER TABLE extend_db_ptrj.dbo.payroll_manual_adjustments
ADD CONSTRAINT UX_payroll_manual_adj_period_emp_type_name_gang
UNIQUE (period_month, period_year, emp_code, adjustment_type, adjustment_name, gang_code);
```

**Catatan:** Jika `gang_code` NULL di beberapa record, perlu handle NULL dalam unique constraint (GIST: SQL Server treats NULL as distinct, so multiple NULL gang_code won't violate unique constraint).

### Recommendation 3: Row-Level Locking untuk Check-then-Act

**Gunakan `SELECT ... WITH (UPDLOCK, HOLDLOCK)` untuk prevent concurrent insert:**

```typescript
const existing = await db.queryOne<{ id: number }>(`
    SELECT TOP 1 id FROM dbo.payroll_manual_adjustments WITH (UPDLOCK, HOLDLOCK)
    WHERE period_month = ? AND period_year = ?
    AND (emp_code = ? OR nik = ? OR emp_code = ?)
    AND adjustment_type = ?
    AND ${normalizedAdjustmentNameSql} = ?
`, [...]);
```

`UPDLOCK` → acquire update lock on rows, prevents other transactions from acquiring update lock on same rows.
`HOLDLOCK` → hold lock until transaction completes (serializable isolation).

### Recommendation 4: Atomic Upsert dengan MERGE

**Tidak perlu check-then-act jika pakai MERGE:**

```typescript
// SQL Server MERGE: atomic upsert
await db.query(`
    MERGE INTO dbo.payroll_manual_adjustments AS target
    USING (SELECT ? AS period_month, ? AS period_year, ? AS emp_code, ...) AS source
    ON target.period_month = source.period_month
       AND target.period_year = source.period_year
       AND target.emp_code = source.emp_code
       AND target.adjustment_type = source.adjustment_type
       AND target.adjustment_name = source.adjustment_name
    WHEN MATCHED THEN
        UPDATE SET amount = source.amount, ...
    WHEN NOT MATCHED THEN
        INSERT (...) VALUES (...);
`, [...]);
```

**Benefit:** Single statement, atomic, no race window.

### Recommendation 5: Idempotency Key di Frontend

```typescript
// Di CustomPayrollTable.jsx
const [pendingSaveId, setPendingSaveId] = useState(null);

const performSaveAllEdits = async () => {
    if (pendingSaveId) return; // Prevent double call
    const saveId = crypto.randomUUID();
    setPendingSaveId(saveId);
    try {
        // ... save logic ...
    } finally {
        setPendingSaveId(null);
    }
};
```

### Recommendation 6: Validation Layer

Tambahkan di `saveAdjustment()` sebelum DB call:

```typescript
// 1. Period validation
if (!Number.isInteger(data.period_month) || data.period_month < 1 || data.period_month > 12) {
    throw new Error('period_month harus 1-12');
}
if (!Number.isInteger(data.period_year) || data.period_year < 2000 || data.period_year > 2100) {
    throw new Error('period_year tidak valid');
}

// 2. Amount range
if (!Number.isFinite(parsedAmount)) {
    throw new Error('amount harus number valid');
}

// 3. metadata_json JSON validation
if (metadataJsonStr) {
    try {
        JSON.parse(metadataJsonStr); // throws if invalid
    } catch {
        throw new Error('metadata_json format tidak valid');
    }
}

// 4. Duplicate check before insert
if (!existing) {
    const duplicateCheck = await db.queryOne<{ id: number }>(`
        SELECT id FROM dbo.payroll_manual_adjustments
        WHERE ... (same conditions as saveAdjustment SELECT)
    `);
    if (duplicateCheck) {
        // Concurrent insert detected — use UPDATE instead
        existing = duplicateCheck;
    }
}
```

